## .gitignore für C# / .NET Projekte (Visual Studio, Rider, VS Code)

### Build-Ergebnisse
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Rr]elease/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]uild/
msbuild.log
msbuild.err
msbuild.wrn

### Visual Studio Dateien
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

### Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

### VS Code
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

### NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

### Test-Ergebnisse
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

### ASP.NET
.dockerignore
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json
!appsettings.Development.json
wwwroot/dist/

### Datenbank
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf

### Rider/ReSharper
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

### Sonstige generierte Dateien
*.pdb
*.cache
*.dll
*.exe
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak

### OS-spezifisch
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

### Umgebungs- und Secret-Dateien
*.env
secrets.json
*.pfx
*.snk

### Publish-Ordner
publish/
PublishProfiles/*.pubxml.user

### Node (falls Frontend eingebunden ist, z.B. Blazor/React-Hybrid)
node_modules/